    each archive.

hand-firmware/data/vendor/
    Bundled browser libraries retain their original licences. They are vendored
    rather than loaded from a CDN because the ESP32 serves the dashboard from
    an offline WiFi access point with no internet route.

docs/
    The written report, its figures, and the EEG recordings under
    eeg-classifier/DATA/ are academic work submitted to Birzeit University.
    They are published here for reference and reproducibility, not for reuse.
